# Files into the test chat's composer from outside (mbui's src/host/win_files.h, win_device.h): Explorer's copied file
# and a bitmap alone (a screenshot's) pasted with Ctrl+V in the composer, which takes the cursor as the chat opens (the
# runner puts each on the clipboard: e2e/win.sh files_do); then ＋, the system's file dialog, which MBUI_PICK_FILES
# answers (a photo and a file); all put up to the station.
timeout 60000
#station tap 端到端测试
#station until icon:plus
#station log do: clip-files
#station done clip-files
#station key cmd+v
# (a file's card says its name and its kind apart: e2e-paste, .txt)
#station until e2e-paste
#station log do: clip-picture
#station done clip-picture
#station key cmd+v
# (a picture its tile, drawn from the bytes the composer keeps: mem:writing/…)
#station until img:mem:writing/
#station tap icon:plus
#station until e2e-data
#station untiln 2 img:mem:writing/
#station shot 5-files
#station timeout 180000
#station gone 正在上传
exit
